                ],
                [
                    'type' => 'p',
                    'text' => 'Crawl space water damage in Rocky Mount, NC is easy to miss and costly to ignore. A broken supply line, a failed water heater, storm runoff or a high water table can leave standing water under your house for days. Our crew pumps it out, removes soaked insulation, treats the soil and framing, and dries joists and subfloors until the readings prove they are dry.',
                ],
                [
